(409, 'WoodMart 8.4.1 Thème WooCommerce polyvalent', 35000, 3500, 'uploads/6a0364fa82a75_01_theme-preview.jpg', 'uploads/6a0364fa82b04_woodmartwordpresstheme.zip', '1', 'Thèmes E-commerce,Thèmes WooCommerce', '2026-05-12 17:35:54', 'Admin', '<p><span dir=\"auto\">Compatible avec les derni&egrave;res versions de WordPress 6.9 et sup&eacute;rieures, ainsi qu\'avec WooCommerce 10 et sup&eacute;rieures.</span></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://xtemos.com/woodmart-8-4-update/?client_id=211473374.1778261047&session_id=1778607073\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.envatousercontent.com/a2ed0c4e868d4b42d2578c043d806814fd8d4a7b/68747470733a2f2f7874656d6f732e636f6d2f73637265656e2f776f6f646d6172742f382e342e302d312e6a7067\" alt=\"WoodMart\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://xtemos.com/image-optimizer/?client_id=211473374.1778261047&session_id=1778607073\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.envatousercontent.com/b3e4ef71545c85b542263f6a68805e67b3418e3d/68747470733a2f2f7874656d6f732e636f6d2f73637265656e2f776f6f646d6172742f696d6167652d6f7074696d697a65722d706c7567696e2e6a7067\" alt=\"WoodMart\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.envatousercontent.com/4389d5f35f8ac66d4afce1c3d9f3a9396e143d35/68747470733a2f2f7874656d6f732e636f6d2f73637265656e2f776f6f646d6172742f323032342f322e6275696c646572732e6a7067\" alt=\"WoodMart\" width=\"300\"></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://woodmart.xtemos.com/?client_id=211473374.1778261047&session_id=1778607073\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.envatousercontent.com/a8fd790ad93b89c5f0a868923cc7070053793c05/68747470733a2f2f7874656d6f732e636f6d2f73637265656e2f776f6f646d6172742f7072656275696c742d77656273697465733130302e6a7067\" alt=\"WoodMart\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"item-description__why-woodmart\"><span dir=\"auto\">Pourquoi WoodMart ?</span></h2>\r\n<p><span dir=\"auto\">Plus de&nbsp;</span><strong><span dir=\"auto\">100&nbsp;000 commer&ccedil;ants</span></strong><span dir=\"auto\">&nbs